<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 1: COVER ═══════════════ -->
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小六 · 第 12 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">SSPA專項：Word Problems+幾何題滿分</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">上學期 · SSPA 備戰系列 · 65 min · 1-on-3 Online Lesson</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》6上A冊 百Fraction·Speed/Rate·Circle ＋ 呈分試歷屆試題 2021-2025<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>T4 百Fraction應用「比...多」vs「是...的」混淆；T8 Circle周率=3.14還是22/7；T6 Speed/Rate=距離÷時間<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">高頻</span> Word Problems和幾何題佔呈分試卷約 35-50%，決定A/B等級<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>L01-L11 百Fraction·Fraction運算·CircleArea/Perimeter·Speed/Rate公式·四則運算<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>① 百FractionWord Problems秒圈關鍵詞 ② CirclePerimeter/Area公式零混亂 ③ Speed/Rate三步法 ④ 70%呈分試真題模式
  </div>
