<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 2: WARM-UP + KP1 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 SSPA衝刺·限時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">模擬真實SSPA考試！限時作答，每題計分。答對率達80%解鎖「SSPA戰士」勳章！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⚡ 開始模擬考 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>200 的 15% 是多少？</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>Circle形半徑 7 cm。CirclePerimeter = ？（取 =3.14）</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>一架車 3 小時行 180 km。平均Speed/Rate = ？</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>原價 $200，八折後售價 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>Circle形半徑 4 cm。Area = ？（取 =3.14）</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：百FractionWord Problems — 關鍵詞識別法 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>四種百Fraction題型：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>求部分</strong>：「...的 X%」→ 整體 × 百Fraction（例：200的15% = 200×0.15=30）<br/>
      ② <strong>求整體</strong>：「部分佔整體的 Y%」→ 整體 = 部分 ÷ 百Fraction<br/>
      ③ <strong>求百Fraction</strong>：「A是B的...%」→ 百Fraction = A÷B×100%<br/>
      ④ <strong>變化率</strong>：「比原來多了/少了 Z%」→ 新值 = 原值 × (1±Z%)<br/>
<strong>Trap關鍵詞區分：</strong>「是...的」≠「比...多」——前者直接乘，後者要加1
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">Trap引爆例題 — 「比...多」vs「是...的」</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">蘋果原價 $50。（A）蘋果是橙的 80%。橙多少元？（B）蘋果比橙貴 25%。橙多少元？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake</div><div class="eq">(A) 橙 = 50÷0.8=62.5    (B) 橙 = 50×0.75=37.5</div><div class="why">(B)「比...貴25%」意思係橙×(1+25%)=50，所以橙=50÷1.25，不是50×0.75</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">正確解法</div><div class="eq">(A) 橙 = 50÷0.8 = $62.5   (B) 橙 = 50÷1.25 = $40</div><div class="why">關鍵詞決定公式：「是...的」→Division；「比...多」→先還原1倍</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">Mnemonic：「是就除，多就加一除，少就減一除。圈關鍵詞再決定公式。」</div>
<div class="lf-h2">KP1 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>書架有 320 本書，小說佔 45%。小說有多少本？</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>小明有 $180，是弟弟的 120%。弟弟有多少元？</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>一件貨品比原價貴了 30%，現售 $520。原價多少？</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>某數的 12.5% 是 25。求該數。</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 3: KP2 — CirclePerimeter與Area ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：CirclePerimeter與Area — 公式零混亂 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>必須記住兩個公式（不能調轉！）：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>Perimeter</strong>：C = 2r = d（一條線的長度，單位：cm/m）<br/>
      ② <strong>Area</strong>：A = r²（一個面的範圍，單位：cm²/m²）<br/>
      ③ = 3.14（精確計算）或 <span class="f"><span class="n">22</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span>（Fraction題）<br/>
      ④ <strong>半CirclePerimeter ≠ 半個Circle周</strong>：半CirclePerimeter = r + 2r（弧長+直徑！）
    </div>
</div>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:6px 0;">
<svg height="160" viewbox="0 0 180 160" width="180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<circle cx="90" cy="70" fill="#DBEAFE" r="60" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></circle>
<circle cx="90" cy="70" fill="#1A3C6D" r="3"></circle>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="90" y="63">O</text>
<line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" x1="90" x2="150" y1="70" y2="70"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="120" y="63">r</text>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="5,2" stroke-width="2" x1="30" x2="150" y1="78" y2="78"></line>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="90" y="92">d=2r</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">Trap引爆例題 — 半CirclePerimeter</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">一個半Circle形花圃，直徑 14 m。求其Perimeter。（取 = 22/7）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake</div><div class="eq">半CirclePerimeter = 14÷2×22/7 = 22 m</div><div class="why">只計左弧長（半個Circle周），忘左仲有直徑！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">正確解法</div><div class="eq">半CirclePerimeter = r + d = 7×22/7 + 14 = 22 + 14 = <strong>36 m</strong></div><div class="why">半CirclePerimeter = 弧長(半個Circle周) + 直徑</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="warn">最高頻Trap：CirclePerimeter和Area公式調轉！C有d/r，A有r²。單位也不同：Perimeter是cm，Area是cm²。</div>
<div class="lf-h2">KP2 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>Circle形半徑 5 cm。求Area。（ = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>Circle形直徑 20 cm。求Perimeter。（ = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>一個半Circle，半徑 10 cm。求Perimeter。（ = 3.14，留意：弧長 + 直徑）</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>一個Circle形花圃Perimeter是 62.8 m。求其半徑。（ = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 4: KP3 — Speed/Rate ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：Speed/RateWord Problems — 三步法 + 單位Trap <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">SSPA 高頻</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>Speed/Rate萬能公式：</strong>距離 = Speed/Rate × 時間<br/>
      ① <strong>公式變形</strong>：Speed/Rate = 距離 ÷ 時間   時間 = 距離 ÷ Speed/Rate（三個量知二求一）<br/>
      ② <strong>單位一致性Trap</strong>：Speed/Rate km/h，時間必須是「小時」，不是「min」！<br/>
      ③ 時間轉換：min÷60=小時   或全部轉min用minSpeed/Rate<br/>
      ④ <strong>SSPA常考</strong>：中途停留、不同路段不同Speed/Rate
    </div>
</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">1</div><div class="t">圈單位</div><div class="d">Speed/Rate單位是km/h還是m/min？</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">2</div><div class="t">統一單位</div><div class="d">時間必須和Speed/Rate單位一致</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">3</div><div class="t">選公式</div><div class="d">D=S×T／S=D÷T／T=D÷S</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">4</div><div class="t">代數+答句</div><div class="d">計算＋完整答句</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">Trap引爆例題 — 時間單位不一致</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">一輛巴士以 72 km/h 行駛 30 min。行了多少 km？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake</div><div class="eq">距離 = 72 × 30 = 2160 km</div><div class="why">30係min，但Speed/Rate係km/h！必須轉成小時：30min=0.5h</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">正確解法</div><div class="eq">距離 = 72 × 0.5 = <strong>36 km</strong></div><div class="why">30min = 30÷60 = 0.5 小時</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">Mnemonic：「Speed/Rate、距離、時間，知二求一。Speed/Rate用km/h，時間要跟小時。」</div>
<div class="lf-h2">KP3 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>一架車 2.5 小時行 200 km。平均Speed/Rate = ？</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>火車Speed/Rate 90 km/h，行 6 min。距離 = ？km</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>單車手Speed/Rate 15 km/h。行 45 km 要多少時間？（以min作答）</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>甲車 80 km/h，乙車 60 km/h。同時同地出發，2小時後兩車相距多遠？（同方向）</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 5: KP4 + TIERED ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點四：常見幾何圖形Area — Triangle·Trapezoid·長方體 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <strong>TriangleArea</strong>：A = <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> × b × h（底×高÷2）<br/>
      ② <strong>TrapezoidArea</strong>：A = <span class="f"><span class="n">(a+b)h</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>（上底+下底）×高÷2<br/>
      ③ <strong>長方體Volume</strong>：V = l × w × h（長×闊×高）<br/>
      ④ <strong>Trap</strong>：TriangleArea忘了÷2；Trapezoid忘了加兩個底
    </div>
</div>
<div class="geo-row">
<svg height="120" viewbox="0 0 190 150" width="150" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="35,100 155,100 35,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon>
<polyline fill="none" points="43,10 43,18 35,18" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polyline>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="35" x2="35" y1="20" y2="100"></line>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="21" y="60">h</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="14" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="95" y="122">b</text>
</svg>
<svg height="105" viewbox="0 0 210 135" width="160" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="35,95 175,95 145,20 65,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon>
<line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="65" x2="65" y1="20" y2="95"></line>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="77" y="58">h</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="105" y="117">b₂</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="105" y="12">b₁</text>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="lf-h2">KP4 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
