<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 6: TIERED CONT ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h2">Intermediate Tier（共 5 題，Optional）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">27</td><td>一件衫原價 $350，八五折出售。售價 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">28</td><td>Circle直徑 16 cm。求Perimeter和Area。（ = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">29</td><td>A到B：80 km/h × 2h。B到C：60 km/h × 1.5h。總距離 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">30</td><td>某數比 240 多了 35%。求該數。</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">31</td><td>Trapezoid上底 5 cm，下底 12 cm，Area 51 cm²。求高。</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">Challenge Tier（共 3 題，SSPA殺手題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">32</td><td>一個半Circle形操場：半徑 21 m。（a）求Perimeter（b）求Area。取 = 22/7。</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">33</td><td>車從甲地出發，以 70 km/h 行 2 小時，休息 30 min，再以 50 km/h 行 1.5 小時到達乙地。求全程平均Speed/Rate。（km/h，精確至一位Decimal）</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">34</td><td>售價 $270，是原價的 90%。如果再打八折，新售價比原價便宜多少%？</td><td class="qd d4">極限</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:68px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">極限挑戰（共 2 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">35</td><td>一個Circle形噴水池直徑 14 m。外圍有一條闊 2 m 的環形小路。求小路的Area。（取 = 22/7）</td><td class="qd d4">極限</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">36</td><td>甲車 8:00 出發，Speed/Rate 60 km/h。乙車 8:30 出發追趕，Speed/Rate 80 km/h。乙車何時追到甲車？</td><td class="qd d4">極限</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:68px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 7: APPLICATION + HOMEWORK ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">四、SSPAWord Problems（5 題，文字題Trap專項）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">A1</td><td>小明體重 40 kg，小華比他重 25%。小華體重多少 kg？</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">A2</td><td>Circle形蛋糕直徑 20 cm。切出 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 個蛋糕，這部分的Area是多少？（ = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">A3</td><td>媽媽駕車 90 km/h 行 40 min，到達學校。全程有多遠？</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">A4</td><td>Trapezoid花園：上底 8 m，下底 14 m，高 6 m。每平方米種 3 棵花，共可種多少棵？</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">A5</td><td>手錶標價 $800，先加價 15%，後減價 20%。最終售價比原價貴了還是便宜了？差多少%？</td><td class="qd d4">極限</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">五、Homework （課後完成）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)題（共 6 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td>360 的 35% 是多少？</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td>Circle形直徑 10 cm。求Perimeter和Area。（ = 3.14）</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>巴士Speed/Rate 60 km/h，行 3.5 小時。距離 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>Triangle底 15 cm，高 8 cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>45 是 60 的百分之幾？</td><td class="qd d1">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>書包原價 $420，七五折出售。售價 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
