<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>一個 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> Circle形（即270°扇形）半徑 14 cm，求Perimeter。（取 = 22/7，留意：兩條半徑 + 弧長）</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>全程 240 km。前一半路程Speed/Rate 80 km/h，後一半Speed/Rate 60 km/h。求全程平均Speed/Rate。</td><td class="qd d3">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H9</td><td>某數減少了 30% 後是 105。該數原是多少？</td><td class="qd d2">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
